    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12386081/comment/12558111",
          "id": "12558111",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=yseeley%40gmail.com",
            "name": "yseeley@gmail.com",
            "key": "yseeley@gmail.com",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Yonik Seeley",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "How about just using maxDoc() - numDocs()?",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=yseeley%40gmail.com",
            "name": "yseeley@gmail.com",
            "key": "yseeley@gmail.com",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Yonik Seeley",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "created": "2008-01-11T20:34:28.466+0000",
          "updated": "2008-01-11T20:34:28.466+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12386081/comment/12558113",
          "id": "12558113",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=shaie",
            "name": "shaie",
            "key": "shaie",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Shai Erera",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Jerusalem"
          },
          "body": "This is an option, however it will result in two calls to maxDoc() (once by maxDoc() and another by numDocs()).\nLike I wrote, it's more of a convenience method and having a complete and clear API. This way, users of Lucene won't need to ask themselves how to obtain this number - they'll have an explicit API for that.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=shaie",
            "name": "shaie",
            "key": "shaie",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Shai Erera",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Jerusalem"
          },
          "created": "2008-01-11T20:38:36.182+0000",
          "updated": "2008-01-11T20:38:36.182+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12386081/comment/12558201",
          "id": "12558201",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=shaie",
            "name": "shaie",
            "key": "shaie",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Shai Erera",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Jerusalem"
          },
          "body": "A very simple patch that implements numDeletedDocs in all the necessary readers.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=shaie",
            "name": "shaie",
            "key": "shaie",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Shai Erera",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Jerusalem"
          },
          "created": "2008-01-12T05:27:54.777+0000",
          "updated": "2008-01-12T05:27:54.777+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12386081/comment/12558727",
          "id": "12558727",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=otis",
            "name": "otis",
            "key": "otis",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=otis&avatarId=15859",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=otis&avatarId=15859",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=otis&avatarId=15859",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=otis&avatarId=15859"
            },
            "displayName": "Otis Gospodnetic",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "I think maxDoc() is a cheap call, so calling it twice won't be a performance killer, esp. since this is not something you'd call frequently, I imagine.\n\nHowever, I do agree about numDeletedDocs() being nice for hiding implementation details.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=otis",
            "name": "otis",
            "key": "otis",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=otis&avatarId=15859",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=otis&avatarId=15859",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=otis&avatarId=15859",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=otis&avatarId=15859"
            },
            "displayName": "Otis Gospodnetic",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "created": "2008-01-14T18:54:13.775+0000",
          "updated": "2008-01-14T18:54:13.775+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12386081/comment/12628154",
          "id": "12628154",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mikemccand",
            "name": "mikemccand",
            "key": "mikemccand",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Michael McCandless",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "Otis is this one ready to go in?",
